:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Megurine Luka (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Megurine Luka''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Megurine Luka
|image = E 536.png
|appearance = [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
Megurine has low damage, but relatively high health and range and has a chance to [[Warp|warp]] your units back,  as she is more of support for [[Kagamine Rin & Len (Enemy)|Kagamine Rin & Len]] and [[Hatsune Miku (Enemy)|Hatsune Miku]] in the stages she appears in, try to time your units well so they won't be warped, although sometimes her warp can save some of your units from a powerful attack from the other enemies.

